| `antiFinish` equations | Definitional summary; does not replace execution | All `IntSeq` remainders. Empty, code `32`, and non-`32` cases are complete and disjoint; recursion descends on the remainder | Names the whole-program result. Used by the outer claim/bridge and entry claim. |
| `asciiCodes` equations | Definitional domain predicate | All `IntSeq`; constructor-complete and terminating | Aligns the entry theorem with the reference semantics' ASCII model. |
